{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_08_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_08","title":"大夢","storyCode":"WR-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5a8a29f43471877347b4f9962d45a09f1e3f54b5ce0cc5d81411ae66a447d596","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"日復一日的守衛城鎮，讓炎熔，烏有，克洛絲三人逐漸動搖。然而就在此時，黎卻帶來了“墨魎也恐懼爆竹”的情報。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"墨魎，墨，魎，多好的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨那個孩子，是個天生慧根的好苗子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"一次又一次保護著根本不會受損的器物，那是不是總會有一次，他們放棄了心中的那份正義，對這種徒勞的道德感到麻木呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"也許會吧。如果瓷器能夠輕鬆恢復原狀，砸碎它就不會感到心疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你甚至會愛上砸碎它的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，又何必做這麼絕呢......人性是經不起考驗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘎唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"你看著這裡嗎？夕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼壞心眼......可要原諒我接下來的小心思哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩人，總算解決啦......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"可真不是我潑冷水，繼續陪著這些怪物耗下去，咱們何日才能找到離開這裡的線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨說，她會想辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那咱們就在這日復一日地對付墨魎？這也不是什麼好事吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係，不費勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"就當鑽研自己的法術了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"——小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"說呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......你剛才使用的源石技藝，稍微有點危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......？啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了？你燒毀了不少鋪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你啊，小烏有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才是不是有刻意對那隻衝向鎮子的小墨魎視而不見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我那不是相信恩人一定會處理好的嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你想的是，“萬一出了什麼差錯，第二天也會變回原樣的”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我不會否認......就算我心裡有數，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是第七天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是強人所難，守衛沒有意義的目標，日復一日，遲早是會變成這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了在雷姆必拓的那個月......那是場血淋淋的教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥是會折磨人心的，我們該時刻警醒一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......小炎熔，你知道的，我一直......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不會有事的，我們會安安穩穩離開這裡，安安穩穩回到羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"好~回去之後請我喝哥倫比亞咖啡哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨還在房間裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天出門前去看過一眼，大師已經枯坐整整七天啦......恩人呐，你說要真不吃不喝死在這畫裡......會真死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。當時嵯峨只說“交給我吧”，然後二話不說就關門不出了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"最瞭解現在情況的人就是嵯峨，我們也別無選擇，或者你想像她一樣，去其他畫卷遊覽一番？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不不，免了免了。我可不如大師那麼堅定，一個不留神，就徹底出不來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......在嵯峨那邊有什麼結果前，我們也沒什麼能為她做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你們在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐？你來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"來提醒你們，莫要偏離本心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"“假作真時真亦假，無為有處有還無”，我過去這麼勸過嵯峨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，她人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨已經在房間裡冥想許多日了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，她想醒去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有人能主動從畫卷中醒去，不，是從來沒有人能夠做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......說不定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐，你聽說過，“爆竹”這種東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"在大炎，這是一種古老的民俗，當然，起源於——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——驅逐古老的怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......炎熔小姐是異鄉出身的薩卡茲吧？竟然還會對大炎傳統有研究？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是，是我那個朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。我想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以別想起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"是《洪爐示歲》裡的劇情吧？說年害怕爆竹，最後的玄極巨兵也是用護城炮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊啊啊，我不要聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐！爆竹和現在的情況有什麼聯繫嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊......我想，那些墨魎其實也是懼怕爆竹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"只要把爆竹懸在城鎮入口，那些墨魎，自然就不敢靠近啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，那可太方便啦，總算不用日復一日守在這了，我腰都酸啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那事不宜遲，咱們趕緊去鎮上集市瞧瞧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"集市裡，自然是沒有這種東西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——我想也是啊。那怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"總有辦法的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"爆竹，為什麼要叫爆竹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......是因為最早的大炎子民，為了紀念先帝的豐功偉績，以火燒竹子的方法，紀念那場曠世大戰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的還挺多嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒事看看雜書，雜書......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"那就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"給它們準備一個驚喜吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"就這棵，不是挺好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......我看這棵長得還挺好看的，有點可惜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"反正明天會再長出來的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"您倒是一點也不客氣啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了，這些夠不夠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"越多越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"煮傘先生也真是好說話，就這麼把竹子白送給我們啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"若是過意不去，回頭我去向他道聲謝就是。我那當鋪，永遠不會有人贖東西，乾脆就送了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這不合適吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"反正明天就會變回原樣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我是見過柴火劈哩啪啦的樣子，竹子會更響嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說雨後濕竹更加響亮，不過，罷了，這裡可不會下雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就這樣......壘成一個土灶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"火的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"——我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......可控制點火候啊，這裡頭有點學問的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我試試看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！它們來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎、嘎啊——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！它們愣住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"它們跑了？真的被嚇跑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......居然真的有效？這是為什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這就要問年——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......年？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
